{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 15,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 268.436,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Alma and Amulek were commanded to depart out of that city;",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.939,
      "end": 7.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they departed,",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.605,
      "end": 10.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and came out even into the land of Sidom;",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.525,
      "end": 12.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, there they found all the people",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.073,
      "end": 16.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had departed out of the land of Ammonihah,",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 16.364,
      "end": 18.64,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had been cast out and stoned,",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 18.82,
      "end": 21.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they believed in the words of Alma.",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 22.333,
      "end": 32.643,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they related unto them all that had happened unto their wives and children, and also concerning themselves, and of their power of deliverance.",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 33.323,
      "end": 37.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also Zeezrom lay sick at Sidom, with a burning fever,",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 37.358,
      "end": 43.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was caused by the great tribulations of his mind on account of his wickedness,",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 43.204,
      "end": 46.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he supposed that Alma and Amulek were no more;",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 46.96,
      "end": 50.954,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he supposed that they had been slain because of his iniquity.",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 51.134,
      "end": 52.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this great sin,",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 52.893,
      "end": 55.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his many other sins, did harrow up his mind",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 56.092,
      "end": 60.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until it did become exceedingly sore, having no deliverance;",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 60.591,
      "end": 64.213,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he began to be scorched with a burning heat.",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 64.893,
      "end": 69.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, when he heard that Alma and Amulek were in the land of Sidom,",
      "verse": "15:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 69.206,
      "end": 71.528,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "his heart began to take courage;",
      "verse": "15:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 71.708,
      "end": 76.631,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he sent a message immediately unto them, desiring them to come unto him.",
      "verse": "15:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 77.311,
      "end": 83.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they went immediately, obeying the message which he had sent unto them;",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 83.25,
      "end": 86.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they went in unto the house unto Zeezrom;",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 86.634,
      "end": 91.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they found him upon his bed, sick, being very low with a burning fever;",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 91.319,
      "end": 95.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his mind also was exceedingly sore because of his iniquities;",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 95.354,
      "end": 98.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when he saw them he stretched forth his hand,",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 98.785,
      "end": 101.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and besought them that they would heal him.",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 101.973,
      "end": 105.828,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Alma said unto him, taking him by the hand:",
      "verse": "15:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 106.008,
      "end": 109.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believest thou in the power of Christ unto salvation?",
      "verse": "15:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 109.846,
      "end": 111.379,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he answered and said:",
      "verse": "15:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 111.559,
      "end": 114.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I believe all the words that thou hast taught.",
      "verse": "15:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 115.072,
      "end": 116.512,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma said:",
      "verse": "15:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 116.692,
      "end": 120.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If thou believest in the redemption of Christ thou canst be healed.",
      "verse": "15:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 121.366,
      "end": 122.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said:",
      "verse": "15:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 122.846,
      "end": 125.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I believe according to thy words.",
      "verse": "15:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 125.848,
      "end": 128.495,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then Alma cried unto the Lord, saying:",
      "verse": "15:10",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 128.675,
      "end": 130.208,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord our God,",
      "verse": "15:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 130.388,
      "end": 135.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have mercy on this man, and heal him according to his faith which is in Christ.",
      "verse": "15:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 135.712,
      "end": 138.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when Alma had said these words,",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 138.214,
      "end": 141.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Zeezrom leaped upon his feet, and began to walk;",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 141.366,
      "end": 145.36,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this was done to the great astonishment of all the people;",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 145.54,
      "end": 149.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the knowledge of this went forth throughout all the land of Sidom.",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 150.446,
      "end": 153.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma baptized Zeezrom unto the Lord;",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 153.645,
      "end": 156.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he began from that time forth to preach unto the people.",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 157.436,
      "end": 160.687,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma established a church in the land of Sidom,",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 160.867,
      "end": 168.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and consecrated priests and teachers in the land, to baptize unto the Lord whosoever were desirous to be baptized.",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 169.349,
      "end": 171.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they were many;",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 171.99,
      "end": 175.612,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they did flock in from all the region round about Sidom,",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 175.792,
      "end": 177.371,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were baptized.",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 178.051,
      "end": 181.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But as to the people that were in the land of Ammonihah,",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 181.342,
      "end": 185.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they yet remained a hard-hearted and a stiffnecked people;",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 185.655,
      "end": 187.745,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they repented not of their sins,",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 187.925,
      "end": 191.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ascribing all the power of Alma and Amulek to the devil;",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 191.634,
      "end": 194.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they were of the profession of Nehor,",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 194.461,
      "end": 197.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did not believe in the repentance of their sins.",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 198.531,
      "end": 201.132,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Alma and Amulek,",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 201.312,
      "end": 204.563,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amulek having forsaken all his gold, and silver,",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 204.743,
      "end": 208.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his precious things, which were in the land of Ammonihah,",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 209.103,
      "end": 210.821,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the word of God,",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 211.001,
      "end": 214.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he being rejected by those who were once his friends",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 214.385,
      "end": 216.707,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also by his father and his kindred;",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 217.387,
      "end": 222.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, after Alma having established the church at Sidom, seeing a great check,",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 223.093,
      "end": 227.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, seeing that the people were checked as to the pride of their hearts,",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 227.871,
      "end": 231.122,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to humble themselves before God,",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 231.302,
      "end": 239.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to assemble themselves together at their sanctuaries to worship God before the altar, watching and praying continually,",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 239.655,
      "end": 242.023,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might be delivered from Satan,",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 242.203,
      "end": 244.711,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and from death, and from destruction\u2014",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 245.391,
      "end": 246.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now as I said,",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 247.011,
      "end": 249.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Alma having seen all these things,",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 249.42,
      "end": 251.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he took Amulek",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 251.365,
      "end": 253.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and came over to the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 254.099,
      "end": 256.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and took him to his own house,",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 256.462,
      "end": 259.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did administer unto him in his tribulations,",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 259.939,
      "end": 262.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and strengthened him in the Lord.",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 262.987,
      "end": 267.77,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the tenth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi.",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    }
  ]
}